{"ref":"BDB, פַּז²","hw":"פַּז²","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">פַּז</span></big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:11\" href=\"/Psalms.19.11\">ψ 19:11</a></sup> <strong>refined, pure gold (</strong>Talm. <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּיזָּא</span>; 𝔗 <span dir=\"rtl\">פִּיזּוּזָא</span><strong>)</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">עֲטֶרֶת פָּ֑ז</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 21:4\" href=\"/Psalms.21.4\">ψ 21:4</a>; in compar. of value or beauty: <a data-ref=\"Lamentations 4:2\" href=\"/Lamentations.4.2\">La 4:2</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אַדְנֵי־פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:15\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.15\">Ct 5:15</a>; ‖ (or +) <span dir=\"rtl\">זהב</span> <a data-ref=\"Job 28:17\" href=\"/Job.28.17\">Jb 28:17</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(כְּלִי־פ׳)</span>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 19:11\" href=\"/Psalms.19.11\">ψ 19:11</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">רָ֑ב</span>); <a data-ref=\"Psalms 119:127\" href=\"/Psalms.119.127\">119:127</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּתֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 13:12\" href=\"/Isaiah.13.12\">Is 13:12</a>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּתֶם פ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Song of Songs 5:11\" href=\"/Song_of_Songs.5.11\">Ct 5:11</a>; + <span dir=\"rtl\">חָרוּץ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 8:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.8.19\">Pr 8:19</a>.","next":"BDB, פָּזַז²","prev":"BDB, פָּזַז"}